            <p class="feature-desc">Acredita nuestra capacidad técnica y experiencia comprobada en la ejecución de proyectos.</p>
            <span class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="3" y2="15"/></svg> Descargar
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="norms-band" data-aos="fade-up">
          <div class="card--stat card--stat-sm norm-item"><span class="stat-num">ISO 9001</span><span class="stat-label">Calidad</span></div>
          <div class="card--stat card--stat-sm norm-item"><span class="stat-num">ISO 14001</span><span class="stat-label">Medio Ambiente</span></div>
          <div class="card--stat card--stat-sm norm-item"><span class="stat-num">ISO 45001</span><span class="stat-label">Seguridad</span></div>
          <div class="card--stat card--stat-sm norm-item"><span class="stat-num">ISO 37001</span><span class="stat-label">Antisoborno</span></div>
          <div class="card--stat card--stat-sm norm-item"><span class="stat-num">INCE-489</span><span class="stat-label">Cap. Técnica</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Panel: Políticas -->
      <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-politicas">
        <div class="cert-grid">
          <a href="/assets/documentos/politica_alcohol_drogas.pdf" target="_blank" class="feature-item feature-item--card feature-item--accion">
            <span class="feature-num feature-num--marca" aria-hidden="true">PDF</span>
            <div class="feature-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/><path d="M12 8v4"/><path d="M12 16h.01"/></svg></div>
            <p class="panel-label">Política</p>
            <h3 class="feature-title">Alcohol y Drogas</h3>
            <p class="feature-desc">Normativa sobre prevención y control del consumo de sustancias en el entorno de trabajo.</p>
            <span class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="3" y2="15"/></svg> Ver documento
            </span>
          </a>
          <a href="/assets/documentos/politica_negativa_trabajo_inseguro.pdf" target="_blank" class="feature-item feature-item--card feature-item--accion">
            <span class="feature-num feature-num--marca" aria-hidden="true">PDF</span>
            <div class="feature-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/><path d="m14.5 9.5-5 5"/><path d="m9.5 9.5 5 5"/></svg></div>
            <p class="panel-label">Política</p>
            <h3 class="feature-title">Negativa al Trabajo Inseguro</h3>
            <p class="feature-desc">Derecho de los trabajadores a rechazar actividades que pongan en riesgo su seguridad.</p>
            <span class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="3" y2="15"/></svg> Ver documento
            </span>
          </a>
          <a href="/assets/documentos/politica_sig.pdf" target="_blank" class="feature-item feature-item--card feature-item--accion">
            <span class="feature-num feature-num--marca" aria-hidden="true">PDF</span>
            <div class="feature-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 7h-9"/><path d="M14 17H5"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="3"/><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="3"/></svg></div>
            <p class="panel-label">Política</p>
            <h3 class="feature-title">Sistema Integrado de Gestión</h3>
            <p class="feature-desc">Política del Sistema Integrado de Gestión de Calidad, Medio Ambiente y Seguridad.</p>
            <span class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="3" y2="15"/></svg> Ver documento
            </span>
          </a>
          <a href="/assets/documentos/politica_antisoborno.pdf" target="_blank" class="feature-item feature-item--card feature-item--accion">
            <span class="feature-num feature-num--marca" aria-hidden="true">PDF</span>
            <div class="feature-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 11V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2"/><path d="M14 10V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2"/><path d="M10 10.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8"/><path d="M18 8a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v6a8 8 0 0 1-8 8h-2c-2.8 0-4.5-.86-5.99-2.34l-3.6-3.6a2 2 0 0 1 2.83-2.82L7 15"/></svg>
            </div>
